P1: box 
P2: box

T: text "Kiértékelt" "Függvény paraméter" with .s at P2.nw+(0, .11)
spline thin color gray from P1.nw go up .02 \
  then .1 heading 45 \
  then left until even with T.s-(.069,0) \
  then .1 heading 45 
spline thin color gray from P2.ne go up .02 \
  then .1 heading -45 \
  then right until even with T.s+(.069,0) \
  then .1 heading -45

P1c: circle thick fill black rad .03 at P1.c-(0,.07)

text "Függvény" with .s at P1c.n
text "Érték" "0x123987" mono at P2.c

# fn ptr
L: line down from P1c 
text "null" mono with .n at last.s

line from L.s-(.05,.027) to L.s+(.05,.027)
line from L.s-(.05,.027+.027) to L.s+(.05,.027-.027)